5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. To start, I would like to look into the winter road closures north of the river and the county grant terms and the endowment.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be wise to understand our accessibility. I will look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see what we did before! I'll look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are all quite eager. To ensure our ambitions don't outpace our wallet, I shall examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I want to ensure we have the necessary expertise to manage any new service. I will look into the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a very thorough plan for our research. I am glad to see we are considering both the people and the practicalities. Does anyone else feel we are missing something important?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have covered the primary bases for now. I am particularly interested to see if the current transport links are creating barriers for our residents.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I think we're doing great! I just hope we find some secrets in those old papers that help us make a really cool choice. I can't wait to see what happened six years ago!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Rin's enthusiasm for the archives is quite refreshing. I suspect the ghosts of past projects may have more to teach us than the brochures of new ones. I am content with our current list.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree. We have a balanced approach covering finances, accessibility, historical data, and staffing. I believe this will give us a clear picture of what is actually sustainable for the library.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree completely, Minako. It is so heartening to see us all working together with such a thoughtful spirit. I believe we are ready to proceed and see what the records tell us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us move forward and see what information we can gather to best serve the community.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,Me too! Let's go look at the stuff! I'm ready!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we are all in such harmonious agreement, I shall refrain from further commentary. Let us proceed to the discovery phase and see what the data reveals.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us move to the research phase. I look forward to seeing how the facts align with our goals.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
